The item builder

The item builder turns a hero's stock items into any of that hero's
wearables, with particle effects on top. h6rd (https://github.com/h6rd)
wrote it, and develops it further together with TheFleece. It is the code in
src/item-builder.js and renderer/views/item-builder.js, and the parts of other
files that say they belong to it.

Copyright (C) 2026 h6rd (https://github.com/h6rd)
Copyright (C) 2026 TheFleece (https://github.com/TheFleece)

The terms above apply to it, and 7(b) asks one more thing. Whoever ships the
item builder, or code taken from it, in this program or in any other, keeps
both copyright lines in the source files it came in, and names both authors
in the credits that program shows its users: its Appropriate Legal Notices,
which in this program are in Settings under "About".


