Fonts

Three typefaces ship inside the app, under renderer/fonts. They used to be
fetched from Google at every launch, which meant the interface arrived without
them whenever that was slow, blocked or not reachable yet. They are copied
unmodified from Google Fonts and remain under their own licenses:

  Exo 2, by Natanael Gama - SIL Open Font License 1.1
  https://fonts.google.com/specimen/Exo+2

  Inter, by Rasmus Andersson - SIL Open Font License 1.1
  https://fonts.google.com/specimen/Inter

  Material Symbols Rounded, by Google - Apache License 2.0
  https://fonts.google.com/icons

Refresh them with tools/fonts.js, which reads the same stylesheets Google
serves so the weights and character ranges stay the ones the app was built
against.
